{"rpid": "5753683", "root": "0", "parent": "0", "uname": "火鹰", "mid": "68556", "level": 6, "vip": 0, "content": "如果按照数学的算法，这条算式是少了点东西。正确是1+2+4+······+2^n=(2-1)*(1+2+4+……+2^n)=2+4+8+······+2^n+2^(n+1)-1-2-4-·····-2^n=-1+2^(n+1)。视频中是少了2^(n+1)这一项。但既然他说用物理来解释，这又是为什么呢？\n", "like": 0, "ctime": 1360491272, "rcount": 12, "ip": "", "images": [], "video_aid": "460636", "video_bvid": "BV1Kx411c7VN", "video_title": "一分钟物理-方程理解", "video_desc": "youtube 一分钟物理，再求野生字母菌", "video_owner": "bulibulibuli09", "video_view": 49869, "video_reply": 82, "video_n1": 50, "video_n2": 32}
