{"rpid": "5636349", "root": "0", "parent": "0", "uname": "fecu", "mid": "147962", "level": 6, "vip": 1, "content": "证明对于任意数列A(n)的无穷和，它都可以等于任何数。因为S(n)=A(1)+A(2)+...+A(n)，所以A(n)=S(n)-S(n-1),其中S(0)=0,令B(n)=S(n)+c,c为任意数。显然有A(n)=B(n)-B(n-1)。所以A(1)+A(2)+...=(-B(0)+B(1))+(-B(1)+B(2))+(-B(2)+B(3))+...=-B(0)+(B(1)-B(1))+(B(2)-B(2))+...=-B(0)=-S(0)-c=-c,因为c可以为任意数，故A(1)+A(2)+...也可以为任意数。", "like": 0, "ctime": 1360036910, "rcount": 0, "ip": "", "images": [], "video_aid": "460636", "video_bvid": "BV1Kx411c7VN", "video_title": "一分钟物理-方程理解", "video_desc": "youtube 一分钟物理，再求野生字母菌", "video_owner": "bulibulibuli09", "video_view": 49869, "video_reply": 82, "video_n1": 50, "video_n2": 32}
