{"rpid": "5633034", "root": "0", "parent": "0", "uname": "fecu", "mid": "147962", "level": 6, "vip": 1, "content": "我这样写可能会更直观，\n1+2+4+...=\nA(1)+A(2)+A(3)+...=\n(-B(0)+B(1))+(-B(1)+B(2))+(-B(2)+B(3))+...=-B(0)+(B(1)-B(1))+(B(2)-B(2))+...=-B(0)=-(2^0+c)=-1-c，因为c可以为任意数，故-1-c也可以为任意数，故1+2+4+...也可以为任意数。\n", "like": 1, "ctime": 1359991078, "rcount": 0, "ip": "", "images": [], "video_aid": "460636", "video_bvid": "BV1Kx411c7VN", "video_title": "一分钟物理-方程理解", "video_desc": "youtube 一分钟物理，再求野生字母菌", "video_owner": "bulibulibuli09", "video_view": 49869, "video_reply": 82, "video_n1": 50, "video_n2": 32}
{"rpid": "5632542", "root": "0", "parent": "0", "uname": "fecu", "mid": "147962", "level": 6, "vip": 1, "content": "设A(n)=2^（n-1），则A(1)=1,A(2)=2,A(3)=4...又设B(n)=2^n+c，c为任意数，显然有，B(n)-B(n-1)=2^n+c-2^(n-1)-c=2^(n-1)=A(n)。所以，1+2+4+...=A(1)+A(2)+A(3)+...=(B(1)-B(0))+(B(2)-B(1))+(B(3)-B(2))+...=-B(0)+(B(1)-B(1))+(B(2)-B(2))+...=-B(0)=-(2^0+c)=-1-c，因为c可以为任意数，故-1-c也可以为任意数，故1+2+4+...也可以为任意数。", "like": 0, "ctime": 1359988843, "rcount": 0, "ip": "", "images": [], "video_aid": "460636", "video_bvid": "BV1Kx411c7VN", "video_title": "一分钟物理-方程理解", "video_desc": "youtube 一分钟物理，再求野生字母菌", "video_owner": "bulibulibuli09", "video_view": 49869, "video_reply": 82, "video_n1": 50, "video_n2": 32}
{"rpid": "5632521", "root": "0", "parent": "0", "uname": "fecu", "mid": "147962", "level": 6, "vip": 1, "content": "设A(n)=2^（n-1），则A(1)=1,A(2)=2,A(3)=4...又设B(n)=2^n+c，c为任意数，显然有，B(n)-B(n-1)=2^n+c-2^(n-1)+c=2^(n-1)=A(n)。所以，1+2+4+...=A(1)+A(2)+A(3)+...=(B(1)-B(0))+(B(2)-B(1))+(B(3)-B(2))+...=-B(0)+(B(1)-B(1))+(B(2)-B(2))+...=-B(0)=-(2^0+c)=-1-c，因为c可以为任意数，故-1-c也可以为任意数，故1+2+4+...也可以为任意数。", "like": 0, "ctime": 1359988786, "rcount": 0, "ip": "", "images": [], "video_aid": "460636", "video_bvid": "BV1Kx411c7VN", "video_title": "一分钟物理-方程理解", "video_desc": "youtube 一分钟物理，再求野生字母菌", "video_owner": "bulibulibuli09", "video_view": 49869, "video_reply": 82, "video_n1": 50, "video_n2": 32}
